				<wikidot:authorName>Quikngruvn</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>333389</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>First off, guys, getting on someone's case for not finding something funny isn't kosher. Humor is both very broad and highly personal, and you will not find someone who shares your exact taste in humor.</p> <p>Now that that's out of the way, thanks to everyone who's read it, commented, and voted on it. I honestly expected this to do no better than languish in the low single digits, so the reception it's gotten is genuinely surprising. (It's also further evidence that I should get out of the serious SCP-writing business— no promises, though, since my muse is both insane and insistent.)</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
