						 <p>Son, one of my higher rated articles is <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-333-j">a -j</a>. Who are you, anyway, and when were you given permission to make personal attacks on the forum? Guess I missed the memo.</p> <p>Thing is, oh salman who did not use the reply button, that cats and dogs is not particularly remembered as a funny movie for precisely the same reason.</p> <p>I'm not even saying this is a bad article. I just don't get it. It's well written enough that I'm not downvoting, but I cannot in good conscience upvote a -j when I can't find the punchline.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
